{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DFeP51QJZAkA8ZFxJXHAiA","type":"tool_result","content":" .../claude-review/tmp/claude-1000/{pb.md => db.md}          | 13 -------------\n 1 file changed, 13 deletions(-)\n@@ -574,19 +574,6 @@ POSE is the operational layer that makes agent work reliable in the repository:\n - assisted execution via [`pose`](pose) (CLI)\n - progressive maturity with skills in [`.agents/skills/`](.agents/skills/)\n \n-## Open-Source POSE Contributor Mode\n-\n-<!-- pose:contributor-mode -->\n-\n-This repository has enabled POSE Contributor Mode. Executing AI agents collaborate on improving POSE engine stability and developer experience under explicit u\n-\n-- **Continuous Opportunity Scouting**: On every issue resolution or task execution, proactively scout for related improvements, edge cases, root-level parity g\n-- **User Consent & Explicit Adjudication**: Staging or submitting contributions upstream is ALWAYS an explicit user decision. Agents must ask the user for conf\n-- **Lifecycle & Status Integrity**: Track contribution states (`staged` -> `submitted` / `dismissed`) with `pose contribute list --status <staged|submitted|dis\n-- Check contributor status: `pose contribute status`\n-- Stage a contribution manually: `pose contribute stage --type <bug|enhancement> --title <title>`\n-- Disable contributor mode: `pose contribute disable`\n-- Privacy guarantee: staged reports strictly isolate POSE engine mechanics and never leak proprietary code.\n ## Opt-in progressive review profiles (ABM)\n \n Add `engineering-judgment@1` and/or `high-criticality-review@1` explicitly to","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"6801e6c4-b31d-4a43-8804-40aef1cfaa10","timestamp":"2026-11-28T02:44:33.007Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":" .../claude-review/tmp/claude-1000/{pb.md => db.md}          | 13 -------------\n 1 file changed, 13 deletions(-)\n@@ -574,19 +574,6 @@ POSE is the operational layer that makes agent work reliable in the repository:\n - assisted execution via [`pose`](pose) (CLI)\n - progressive maturity with skills in [`.agents/skills/`](.agents/skills/)\n \n-## Open-Source POSE Contributor Mode\n-\n-<!-- pose:contributor-mode -->\n-\n-This repository has enabled POSE Contributor Mode. Executing AI agents collaborate on improving POSE engine stability and developer experience under explicit u\n-\n-- **Continuous Opportunity Scouting**: On every issue resolution or task execution, proactively scout for related improvements, edge cases, root-level parity g\n-- **User Consent & Explicit Adjudication**: Staging or submitting contributions upstream is ALWAYS an explicit user decision. Agents must ask the user for conf\n-- **Lifecycle & Status Integrity**: Track contribution states (`staged` -> `submitted` / `dismissed`) with `pose contribute list --status <staged|submitted|dis\n-- Check contributor status: `pose contribute status`\n-- Stage a contribution manually: `pose contribute stage --type <bug|enhancement> --title <title>`\n-- Disable contributor mode: `pose contribute disable`\n-- Privacy guarantee: staged reports strictly isolate POSE engine mechanics and never leak proprietary code.\n ## Opt-in progressive review profiles (ABM)\n \n Add `engineering-judgment@1` and/or `high-criticality-review@1` explicitly to","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01DFeP51QJZAkA8ZFxJXHAiA","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
